              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ehyezeri, mwana kaDodavwahu wakuMaresha, hakuprofweta mazu akukaanda Yehoshafwati, nindi, Chiwunadibombi dehi naAhaziya, Yehova nakisaŋani dehi nyidimu yeyi. Ninochu maatu abalokeli, hiyatwesheli kuya kuTarashishuku.",
